    "NIRF 2025 College and Overall government listings both contain Career College in Bhopal, Madhya Pradesh.",
    "The official homepage and about/footer identify the campus as Career College Bhopal at Opposite BHEL Dussehra Maidan, Govindpura, Bhopal - 462023.",
    "The central official catalogue covers undergraduate, postgraduate, honours, Ph.D. and apprenticeship-embedded programmes. Department programme pages additionally expose B.Sc. Mathematics, B.Sc. Physics, DMLT and DDT, which were included.",
    "The official certificate page exposes generic MHRD, short-term and certificate/diploma sections, but does not provide a complete active certificate/diploma catalogue; only the two explicitly named in-house online courses were imported.",
    "The official Ph.D. page identifies four research centres and focus areas but does not provide discipline-specific doctoral programme names, duration or eligibility, so the doctoral entry remains unmapped and the overall catalogue is partial.",
    "Official central and department pages use inconsistent or variant NEP labels and some conflicting details, including B.Sc. Botany/Chemistry/Microbiology durations, B.Sc. Computer Science/Information Technology eligibility percentages, and MPT track labels. Central catalogue names and values were retained where available, with unresolved catalogue completeness reflected as manual_review.",
    "The managed proxy returned the exact TLS error 'self signed certificate in certificate chain' on the initial NIRF requests. Subsequent public GETs used curl --insecure only for the confirmed expected official and government hosts; no credentials or private data were sent."
